// The evaluation shows syntax is already perfect, so the bottleneck is semantic
// token choice inside the SQL span. The strategy therefore keeps strict
// constrained decoding, but adds a lightweight schema-aware rescue policy inside
// the span. On each constrained step, it first asks whether the current prefix
